Found while running the generator as the user asked. Their own attempt was
`guild3 -C assets/gen-icon.scm', which fails for an unrelated reason: guild is
the compiler driver and has no -C. The script carries a #!/usr/bin/env guile3
shebang and is meant to be run, not compiled.

The latent bug would have surfaced for anyone who ran it twice. It did not
surface earlier because the only prior run was on a cold cache.

Verified: cmp assets/icon-1-hypotrochoid.svg assets/icon.svg is identical, so
the shipped icon remains reproducible from source.
